    "story_text": "\"Yes. You have reached the Hanezawa residence.\"\n\nThe confirmation arrived flat and exact, without a greeting layered on top of it. The household had been prepared for an arrival; that was a fact of scheduling, not a fact about whoever stood on the threshold. Sakura left the next move unoffered. The caller had received an answer, and that was all she was willing to give until more was established.\n\n\"This is Sakura Hanezawa. I handle the household's formal arrivals.\"\n\nShe let the introduction hang for a moment before adding, \"State your name and your purpose, and I will take the process from there. Until I have them, the process does not move.\"",
